@host = http://localhost:5088
@accountRange = 585240844
@pan = 5555555555554444
@expiryMmYy = 1223
@sourceProductCode = MCG
@swaggerProductCode = MCW
@targetProductCode = MWE
@almServiceCode = 00616
@correlationId = 21ad4488-615b-4004-6158-ec5abff7d58f
@effectiveDate = 2026-09-04

### Sandbox status (includes testData from Postman/swagger examples)
GET {{host}}/api/mastercard/sandbox/status

### End-to-end demo: Postman PAN 5555555555554444, MCG → MWE
POST {{host}}/api/demo/e2e
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceProductCode": "{{sourceProductCode}}",
  "targetProductCode": "{{targetProductCode}}",
  "pan": "{{pan}}"
}

### List product catalog
GET {{host}}/api/products

### Create a card (Postman PAN + ACS swagger expiry 1223)
POST {{host}}/api/cards
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productCode": "{{sourceProductCode}}",
  "pan": "{{pan}}",
  "expiryMmYy": "{{expiryMmYy}}",
  "lookupBin": false
}

### List cards
GET {{host}}/api/cards

### Register PAN (ACS swagger Universal-Spec-Api-Request-Id)
POST {{host}}/api/cards/card_REPLACE_ME/register?correlationId={{correlationId}}

### Upgrade to MCW (ACS swagger productGraduationProductCode example)
POST {{host}}/api/cards/card_REPLACE_ME/upgrades
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetProductCode": "{{swaggerProductCode}}",
  "reason": "CUSTOMER_UPGRADE",
  "correlationId": "{{correlationId}}-mcw"
}

### Upgrade to MWE (same PAN)
POST {{host}}/api/cards/card_REPLACE_ME/upgrades
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetProductCode": "{{targetProductCode}}",
  "reason": "CUSTOMER_UPGRADE"
}

### Legacy upgrade using Postman collection body
POST {{host}}/api/mastercard/upgrade
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pan": "{{pan}}",
  "sourceProductCode": "{{sourceProductCode}}",
  "targetProductCode": "{{targetProductCode}}",
  "effectiveDate": "{{effectiveDate}}",
  "serviceCode": "{{almServiceCode}}"
}

### Issuer vs ACS treatment check
GET {{host}}/api/cards/card_REPLACE_ME/treatment

### Reconcile ACS status
POST {{host}}/api/cards/card_REPLACE_ME/upgrades/mig_REPLACE_ME/reconcile

### Rollback to previous product
POST {{host}}/api/cards/card_REPLACE_ME/upgrades/mig_REPLACE_ME/rollback

### Close / delete ACS registration
POST {{host}}/api/cards/card_REPLACE_ME/close

### Reconcile all open (Submitted/Unknown) migrations
POST {{host}}/api/migrations/reconcile

### Sandbox BIN lookup (Mastercard BIN Lookup Postman example)
POST {{host}}/api/mastercard/sandbox/bin-lookup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "panOrAccountRange": "{{accountRange}}"
}
